msgstr "Risks related to your suppliers and service providers: dependency, access to your data, security of their services."

msgid "Créez un risque par fournisseur important, faites remplir le questionnaire de sécurité, suivez ses contrats et l'onglet « Veille sécurité »."
msgstr "Create one risk per important supplier, have the security questionnaire filled in, follow its contracts and the \"Security watch\" tab."

msgid "ISO 27001, Annexe A 5.19 à 5.22"
msgstr "ISO 27001, Annex A 5.19 to 5.22"

