msgstr "The cyber maturity score (0 to 100): an overview of the progress of your security management system, computed from your data."

msgid "Présentez-le en revue de direction ; le détail du calcul montre quelles composantes améliorer en priorité."
msgstr "Present it in management reviews; the calculation details show which components to improve first."

